# Line endings are LF on every machine that clones this repository, the Windows PC
# included: three docs and two patch headers came back from it with CRLF on
# 2026-09-10, and the next edit on the Mac rewrote every line of the file.
# tooling/check-repo eol refuses a CR byte in any tracked text file.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.dmg binary
